{"id":"n27573-1-8","stage":4,"title":"곡물 · 谷物","scene":"餐饮与生活","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n27573-1-8-1","ko":"지수야, 얼른 아침 먹으렴.","zh":"智秀啊，快去吃早餐吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"지수야,","meaning":"智秀","explanation":"지수：智秀；야：呼格助词，用来称呼关系亲近的人或晚辈。","readings":[{"term":"지수야","audio":"/audio/933aef68208bc459c4d9.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"얼른","meaning":"快地","explanation":"얼른：快地","readings":[{"term":"얼른","audio":"/audio/d658f46882498576d5d6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67315","senseId":"1","lemma":"얼른","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아침","meaning":"早饭，早餐","explanation":"아침：早饭，早餐","readings":[{"term":"아침","audio":"/audio/2fdd736548d881c6da93.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27368","senseId":"2","lemma":"아침","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"먹으렴.","meaning":"吃","explanation":"먹다：吃；으렴：向亲近的人或晚辈发出指示、劝告或请求。","readings":[{"term":"먹다","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58272","senseId":"1","lemma":"먹다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"d658f46882498576","term":"얼른","zh":"快地","audio":"/audio/d658f46882498576d5d6.mp3","entryId":"67315","definition":"不拖延时间就。","pronunciation":["얼른"]},{"id":"2fdd736548d881c6","term":"아침","zh":"早饭，早餐","audio":"/audio/2fdd736548d881c6da93.mp3","entryId":"27368","definition":"早晨吃的饭。","pronunciation":["아침"]},{"id":"9639f892bdddb53f","term":"먹다","zh":"吃","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3","entryId":"58272","definition":"将食物送进口中并咽下。","pronunciation":["먹따"]}],"audio":"/audio/c032e4de709e3bc81260.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n27573-1-8-2","ko":"엄마, 저 좀 늦었어요. 그냥 곡물 가루 우유에 타 주세요.","zh":"妈妈，我有点晚了。就给我用牛奶冲谷物粉吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"엄마,","meaning":"妈妈","explanation":"엄마：妈妈","readings":[{"term":"엄마","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67098","senseId":"1","lemma":"엄마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"저","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"늦었어요.","meaning":"晚，迟到","explanation":"늦다：晚，迟到；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"늦다","audio":"/audio/8678e3dcf30b4fad0aa5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61181","senseId":"1","lemma":"늦다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그냥","meaning":"随便","explanation":"그냥：随便","readings":[{"term":"그냥","audio":"/audio/e32fb95151ec34ccb0d2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36241","senseId":"4","lemma":"그냥","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"곡물","meaning":"谷物，粮食","explanation":"곡물：谷物，粮食","readings":[{"term":"곡물","audio":"/audio/4d1f315f12a8af3e4d0d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27573","senseId":"1","lemma":"곡물","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가루","meaning":"粉末，面儿","explanation":"가루：粉末，面儿","readings":[{"term":"가루","audio":"/audio/42864a47196d1d848539.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65209","senseId":"1","lemma":"가루","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"우유에","meaning":"牛奶","explanation":"우유：牛奶；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"우유","audio":"/audio/2b7e75051be2c51a0337.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26890","senseId":"1","lemma":"우유","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"타","meaning":"冲 ，泡 ，沏，对","explanation":"타다：冲 ，泡 ，沏，对；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"타다","audio":"/audio/8f835109fdc29a59b6ab.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91123","senseId":"1","lemma":"타다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"주세요.","meaning":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","explanation":"주다：为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77245","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"9498f9014908e289","term":"엄마","zh":"妈妈","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3","entryId":"67098","definition":"在非正式场合用于指称或称呼母亲。","pronunciation":["엄마"]},{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"44506","definition":"说话人在听话人面前对自己的谦称。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"主要用于委婉请求或征得同意。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"8678e3dcf30b4fad","term":"늦다","zh":"晚，迟到","audio":"/audio/8678e3dcf30b4fad0aa5.mp3","entryId":"61181","definition":"过了已定的时间。","pronunciation":["늗따"]},{"id":"e32fb95151ec34cc","term":"그냥","zh":"随便","audio":"/audio/e32fb95151ec34ccb0d2.mp3","entryId":"36241","definition":"没有任何想法或别意地。","pronunciation":["그냥"]},{"id":"4d1f315f12a8af3e","term":"곡물","zh":"谷物，粮食","audio":"/audio/4d1f315f12a8af3e4d0d.mp3","entryId":"27573","definition":"米、大麦、小麦、玉米等，主要作为主食的食物。","pronunciation":["공물"]},{"id":"42864a47196d1d84","term":"가루","zh":"粉末，面儿","audio":"/audio/42864a47196d1d848539.mp3","entryId":"65209","definition":"坚硬的物体被粉碎或磨得很小。","pronunciation":["가루"]},{"id":"2b7e75051be2c51a","term":"우유","zh":"牛奶","audio":"/audio/2b7e75051be2c51a0337.mp3","entryId":"26890","definition":"母牛产的奶，制作冰淇淋、黄油、奶酪等时使用的白色液体。","pronunciation":["우유"]},{"id":"8f835109fdc29a59","term":"타다","zh":"冲 ，泡 ，沏，对","audio":"/audio/8f835109fdc29a59b6ab.mp3","entryId":"91123","definition":"在多量液体里加入少量的液体或粉末而搅拌。","pronunciation":["타다"]},{"id":"1b43f195318e9604","term":"주다","zh":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3","entryId":"77245","definition":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","pronunciation":["주다"]}],"audio":"/audio/3d7c3592ff7086be95e0.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.909,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=27573","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":139,"sequenceScore":2.7357,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["妈妈，我有点晚了。就给我用牛奶冲谷物粉吧。","智秀啊，快去吃早餐吧。","敏俊给您的第一印象怎么样？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["智秀啊，快去吃早餐吧。","敏俊给您的第一印象怎么样？","妈妈，我有点晚了。就给我用牛奶冲谷物粉吧。"],"answer":2}]}
